iPart(DT)\->\YR
fPart(DT)*100\->\XX
iPart(XX+.00005)\->\MO
iPart(fPart(XX)*100+.5)\->\DY
iPart(UT)\->\HR
fPart(UT)*100\->\XX
HR+iPart(XX+.00005)/60+fPart(XX)/36\->\HR
367*YR-iPart(7*(YR+iPart((MO+9)/12))/4)\->\DN
DN+iPart(275*MO/9)+DY-730531.5+HR/24\->\DN
(DN+.0008)/36525\->\TC
280.46646+36000.76983*TC\->\LS
357.52911+35999.05029*TC\->\MA
(1.914602-.004817*TC)*sin(MA)\->\CE
CE+.019993*sin(2*MA)+.000289*sin(3*MA)\->\CE
125.04-1934.136*TC\->\OM
0-.00478*sin(OM)\->\PS
23.439291-.0130042*TC+.00256*cos(OM)\->\EP
280.46061837+360.98564736629*DN+PS*cos(EP)\->\GS
(DN-10957.5)/365.25\->\YT
360-SH-RS*YT\->\RA
SC+RD*YT\->\DM
LS+CE\->\LM
.00256*cos(OM)\->\DE
cos(RA)*cos(LM)*cos(EP)+sin(RA)*sin(LM)\->\DA
(0-.0056932)*DA/cos(DM)\->\DA
DA+PS*(cos(EP)+sin(EP)*sin(RA)*tan(DM))\->\DA
DA-DE*cos(RA)*tan(DM)\->\DA
tan(EP)*cos(DM)-sin(RA)*sin(DM)\->\DD
cos(LM)*cos(EP)*DD+cos(RA)*sin(DM)*sin(LM)\->\DD
(0-.0056932)*DD+PS*sin(EP)*cos(RA)+DE*sin(RA)\->\DD
360-RA-DA\->\SX
DM+DD\->\DX
GS\->\AX
AX-360*iPart(AX/360)\->\AX
If AX<0
AX+360\->\AX
SX-360*iPart(SX/360)\->\SX
If SX<0
SX+360\->\SX
AX+SX\->\GX
GX-360*iPart(GX/360)\->\GX
If GX<0
GX+360\->\GX
iPart(abs(AX)*600+.5)\->\KK
If KK\>=\216000
KK-216000\->\KK
iPart(KK/600)+(KK-600*iPart(KK/600))/1000\->\GA
iPart(abs(SX)*600+.5)\->\KK
If KK\>=\216000
KK-216000\->\KK
iPart(KK/600)+(KK-600*iPart(KK/600))/1000\->\SA
iPart(abs(DX)*600+.5)\->\KK
iPart(KK/600)+(KK-600*iPart(KK/600))/1000\->\DC
If DX<0
0-DC\->\DC
iPart(abs(GX)*600+.5)\->\KK
If KK\>=\216000
KK-216000\->\KK
iPart(KK/600)+(KK-600*iPart(KK/600))/1000\->\GH
ClLCD
Disp "GHA ARIES"
